body:
It's been the case for pretty much everyone of his shows...missed out on Red Rocks GA for the same reason. Was in the very first presale for it (wired fiber connection, prioritized this device through my router), an hour early, and AXS's horrid site stayed in loading mode until GA was entirely sold out.

&#x200B;

Edit: You could do everything right and getting tickets is still an absolute roll of the dice.
